[{"id":165342847,"discussion_id":"cb747c7adde7ffb5e45ba299c02a65526f7c1219","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| index | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/2) | ✅ [*tangweiwei2*](https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2), [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (2/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n lvmengge, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-16T11:34:04+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T20:31:38+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165343225,"discussion_id":"d338c1af4aee9608b5b30dd42545027036ba198f","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要包含两项优化。一是优化`ScatterElementsV2`算子在确定性模式下的临时缓冲区大小计算逻辑，将原先使用固定最大空间的方式，改为根据实际的排序维度和数据类型动态计算，以提高内存使用效率和算法适应性。二是同步更新了该算子的两个单元测试用例中的预期平铺数据，以修复因底层平铺算法逻辑变更导致的测试失败问题，确保测试有效性。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改了`GetMaxSortTmpBuf`函数，不再返回固定常量`MAX_SORT_SPACE`，而是根据传入的`sortDim`动态构建张量形状并配置基数排序参数，然后调用`GetSortMaxMinTmpSize`函数，基于索引数据类型计算出精确的临时空间需求并返回。同时，更新了两个确定性模式下的单元测试用例，将其中硬编码的预期平铺数据中的特定大数值替换为更小的值，使其与算子更新后的内部平铺计算逻辑保持一致。","created_at":"2026-03-16T11:36:08+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T11:36:08+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165343241,"discussion_id":"c3c4f04bec123f498da4b8ae05ca99120fc580e9","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-16T11:36:14+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T11:36:14+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165345102,"discussion_id":"37da8ec3b7eea72c28df2acbd701e4d3c3de662a","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-16T11:45:36+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T11:45:36+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165345213,"discussion_id":"86aeb882eef9b38763b9ff08965efaae868ceb50","body":"compile","created_at":"2026-03-16T11:46:11+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T11:46:11+0